- [ ] No credential material appears in code, pipeline configuration or logs
- [ ] Outbound calls to the OPF API enforce TLS 1.2 or higher, verified from the service runtime
- [ ] Rotation procedure for the Code Connect secret is documented, with owner and cadence
- [ ] ISO and Cyber approval to send payloads without payload-level encryption is granted and the UTEP for account numbers over TLS only is approved under the hosting ASV

