### Edit 143560, Implement pain.001.001.11 XML generation from the Payment Exchange payment object

Title, replace with: Wire the pain.001 mapper into the Wire Rail II service as the generation step
Points: 3 (was 5)

Description, replace with:
The conversion itself is built in the mapper library. This story integrates that library into the Wire Rail II service as the first step of the request: accept the validated payment object from the API, call the mapper, validate the result against the V11 schema, populate the UETR received from PayX, carry the supplementary data (FX debit currency and amount, initiator, approver) into the V11 per-context envelopes, and hand the document to the JSON serialisation step. Mapping failures return a distinguishable error to the caller with the field that caused them, and nothing is persisted or sent onward.

Acceptance criteria:

