## 7. Comment for the Capability 3 epic

The submit step described here is implemented inside Wire Rail II as a synchronous call, not as a separate service: there is no SQS hop, no pain.002 or MQ outcome is consumed in Phase 1, and the clearing stages are produced by the PayX integration service from the Bank Wire Rail II response. The work is tracked under Capability 10: direct submission to the OPF API, the response contract to PayX, DynamoDB persistence, and the QA verification of the clearing stages. Proposal: close this epic as superseded by Capability 10, or keep it as a pointer with the description updated and no stories of its own.
